{"title":"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> consider the complex number\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/a/efa8870a65344fd19bb1843e0130aa79b3485967.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\sqrt{ab+2016}}{ab+100}-\\left({\\frac{\\sqrt{|a+b|}}{ab+100}}\\right)i\\]\" width=\"223\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>Find the number of ordered pairs of integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> such that this complex number is a real number.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We consider two cases:\n</p><p><b>Case 1:</b>  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/f/aefacf37a7a14fb3ba5b147208a9cbe75bb1d360.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab \\ge -2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" />.  \n</p><p>In this case, if\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f43eaba271f440e7ef9bbf533889c9069c629d28.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0 = \\text{Im}\\left({\\frac{\\sqrt{ab+2016}}{ab+100}-\\left({\\frac{\\sqrt{|a+b|}}{ab+100}}\\right)i}\\right) = -\\frac{\\sqrt{|a+b|}}{ab+100}\\]\" width=\"418\" height=\"53\" />\nthen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3ad0323857fe564740beed580434bc677eb40fbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab \\ne -100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/4/3f4ddc739b89a7b84b8db471c5d17f3e5f72e8a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a + b| = 0 = a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"147\" height=\"18\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/0/430e16b5df62decb58eb442a8f75791eb9ccd86e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = -a^2$\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/2/022e543ab410ce2622b116d7a17df14464f8fa3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 &lt; 2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/5/665dae7763ffb0858ca308bcb81ff3a9c5be10ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -44,-43, ... , -1, 0, 1, ..., 43, 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"271\" height=\"16\" />, yielding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/0/e609f93104b193a2355181ca62ff083ea9fd3821.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$89$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> values. However since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/0/3d04cce5a95f51ec0976262538a16b3888e1234b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = -a^2 \\ne -100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"19\" />,  we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/d/f4df94230e6b7424cde35e1539976829a8a50fb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ne \\pm 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"17\" />.  Thus there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/1/711f5fc6f8d53d2565cff62b15f932f02e0dbc58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$87$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> allowed tuples <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> in this case.\n</p><p><b>Case 2:</b>  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/5/bf5674bf7415e7bced2c09fe9074a31d761dab19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab &lt; -2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p><p>In this case, we want\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a1b459ba7a248bdd84f6733c2a78c6f697004dd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0 = \\text{Im}\\left({\\frac{\\sqrt{ab+2016}}{ab+100}-\\left({\\frac{\\sqrt{|a+b|}}{ab+100}}\\right)i}\\right) = \\frac{\\sqrt{-ab-2016} - \\sqrt{|a+b|}}{ab+100}\\]\" width=\"532\" height=\"53\" />\nSquaring, we have the equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3ad0323857fe564740beed580434bc677eb40fbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab \\ne -100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"17\" /> (which always holds in this case) and \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/f/fdfbc21b53b3752e9d53febc52afea59b324d1ac.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-(ab + 2016)= |a + b|.\\]\" width=\"180\" height=\"18\" />\nThen if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/5/d25634d7212302efdeb3702974863759bfb74d6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/a/beab3b5c143f2b58c18e15cdb470a15386701dab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/8/96873b33a46d9c929aae91d108dd70e907f7ea99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = -b$\" width=\"54\" height=\"12\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/2/602e211de3a0f69f7d22420aefcba5834d71bf8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c &gt; a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"10\" />, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/8/718187e91fc7f1b29feaedb3c779189c45d51d46.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ac - 2016 = c - a \\Rightarrow (a - 1)(c + 1) = 2015 \\Rightarrow (a,b) = (2, -2014), (6, -402), (14, -154), (32, -64).\\]\" width=\"733\" height=\"18\" />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/5/bf5674bf7415e7bced2c09fe9074a31d761dab19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab &lt; -2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" /> for every one of these solutions.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/2/ea2acbaa6f84b907f4adde7ac11330b8433c5044.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c &lt; a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"10\" />, then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/b/bebd0f411c6b1612a26a9f12a120300423a4ef55.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ac - 2016 = a - c \\Rightarrow (a + 1)(c - 1) = 2015 \\Rightarrow (a,b) = (2014, -2), (402, -6), (154, -14), (64, -32).\\]\" width=\"733\" height=\"18\" />\nAgain, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/5/bf5674bf7415e7bced2c09fe9074a31d761dab19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab &lt; -2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" /> for every one of the above solutions. This yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions.  Similarly, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/1/c319a78bbce71ba12b4ccb52f0b0b793ef760f58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ff39ba262fdf0fc8425b3548976378ba294afba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions.  Thus, there are a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> solutions in this case.\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/c/1ec4df5cc7a6addc4b0eed6823cb4be45d9c327b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$87 + 16 = \\boxed{103}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"122\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I\" title=\"2016 AIME I\">2016 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2016\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2016 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017192058\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 250/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1786/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 108/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6608/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.995      1 -total\n 59.09%    7.679      1 Template:AIME_box\n 39.09%    5.080      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:14851:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017192058 and revision id 209582. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}